# TCP ports a DSGW-210 may answer as OPEN from its LAN (end0), one per line.
# Measured on DUT2 BOSv1.6.0-dev16 2026-11-23 (nmap -sT -p- from the LAN):
#   80    Home Assistant frontend (GA http entry)
#   22222 sshd (certificate auth, ADR-0019)
# Everything else must be filtered (default deny). Adding a port is a security review.
80
22222
